OL,3,GNEWSAStudents must adapt to AI, says
OL,4,Aeducation boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of an education provider has
OL,7,Fsaid students will need to adapt to
OL,8,Fchanging employer demands due to new
OL,9,Ftechnology and artificial intelligence
OL,10,F(AI).
OL,12,FThe Guernsey Institute (TGI) has
OL,13,Flaunched a survey asking employers what
OL,14,Fskills they expect employees to need in
OL,15,Fthe future.
OL,17,FExecutive principal Dr Louise Misselke
OL,18,Fsaid it was the first survey of its
OL,19,Fkind for 12 years and she foreshadowed
OL,20,FAI would play a big part of the
OL,21,Fresponses.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
